      "msg_id": 6689,
      "text": "U.S. intelligence to the U.S. State Department:\n\nWe have received intelligence through various channels indicating that Iran has significantly intensified its efforts to target American personnel. Iranian plots to carry out lethal operations against American citizens have reached advanced stages, both in the Middle East and in some other countries.",
